**Crestline Fleet Account restocking relief — lapsed Tire Sets & Treadwear Limited Warranty orders.** A lapsed order for a vehicle enrolled today on a fleet roster is relieved of part of the line's full restocking fee — the line's restocking percentage of the tire price paid:

- enrolled on the roster of an active Crestline Fleet Account — relieved of 20% of the line's full restocking fee;
- enrolled on the roster of a Crestline Fleet Account that is not active — relieved of 10% of it;
- any other order — relieved of nothing.

A vehicle is enrolled today when it has a roster enrollment with no removal dated after it. Each relief is worked out on its own, and the restocking fee less its reliefs is never below 0.

**Worked (hypothetical $400.00 tire price paid on a 15% line):** the full restocking fee is $60.00; an active account is relieved of $12.00 and an inactive one of $6.00.
